# B10: the side panel below wide is a modal drawer, a layer of the window's overlay stack, and a
# voice room card's failed Join says so in a short toast.
#
# At 900 wide: the header's pins open the drawer and Escape closes it. The notification centre,
# opened from the "All communities" sheet, likewise; with it open, Tab stays in the drawer, so
# five Tabs and Enter open a notification and never reach Squad Up's Join under the scrim. Then
# the card's Join itself: the fake server has no LiveKit, so the join fails and the toast says
# so, in a toast that fits the centre island.
app 900 800
wait idle
click auth-connect
wait core session signed-out within 5
wait idle
click auth-username
type "alexk"
click auth-password
type "hunter2"
click auth-login
wait core session signed-in
wait core channel $ID(cc-general)
wait core rows >= 5
wait idle

# 1. Pins in the drawer; Escape closes it.
click header-more
click header-more-pins
wait core side-panel pins
wait core element drawer-panel
wait idle
shot 01-pins-drawer
press escape
wait core side-panel none
wait core no-element drawer-panel

# 2. The notification centre from the sheet, in the drawer; Escape closes it.
click dock-all
wait core element sheet-notifications
click sheet-notifications
wait core element notifications-close
wait idle
shot 02-notifications-drawer
press escape
wait core no-element notifications-close
wait core no-element drawer-panel

# 3. Tab is trapped in the drawer: nothing under the scrim is reached. From Close, five Tabs
# reach the second notification ("Mark all as read", then the first row and its two buttons),
# and Enter opens it: pri's DM, not a join of Squad Up under the scrim.
click dock-all
wait core element sheet-notifications
click sheet-notifications
wait core element notifications-close
wait idle
press tab
press tab
press tab
press tab
press tab
press enter
wait core no-element notifications-close
wait core text "did you see gracie posted the pit screenshot"
wait idle
expect core w9v join-failed gone
navigate /community/$ID(c-couch)/channel/$ID(cc-general)
wait core channel $ID(cc-general)
wait idle

# 4. The card's Join fails (no LiveKit here): the voice notice in the call slot (B11), with Retry,
# and still on #general.
click room-join-$ID(vc-squad)
wait core w9v join-failed shown
wait core element voice-notice
wait core element voice-notice-action
wait core channel $ID(cc-general)
wait idle
shot 03-join-failed-notice
# Dismiss takes it away.
click voice-notice-dismiss
wait core w9v join-failed gone
wait core no-element voice-notice
